# Build context of the client image (Dockerfile). An allow-list: only what the image is built from is
# sent, so client bundles (passwords, SQL), .env files, the CTW admin tool, docs and the Python tooling
# can never end up in a client's image. (.dockerignore stays the rule for the dev container.)
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/
!scripts/build.js
!vciso-platform/vciso-app/
vciso-platform/vciso-app/node_modules/
vciso-platform/vciso-app/dist/
vciso-platform/vciso-app/.env*
